        <p class="sample" data-illustrative><span class="tag">Sample</span>Alert → duty officer · clip 00:30 · task R-0142 opened</p></div></div></li>
      <li class="beat step" data-beat="story-4"><div class="wrap w-full"><div class="col card-m">
